data: {"seq":602,"ts":"2026-08-24T07:02:41.974Z","id":"call_b07aebc3d739452ab118a7d6","name":"fw_get_function_source","is_error":false,"preview":"{\n \"source\": \"// addr=0x5233c4 name=soap_device_callback arch=mips32be size=0\\nint __fastcall soap_device_callback(int a1, int a2, unsigned int *a3)\\n{\\n  const char *v3; // $s4\\n  _BOOL4 v4; // $v0\\n  int v6; // $a1\\n  int hdr; // $v0\\n  int v8; // $v0\\n  int hdr_str; // $v0\\n  char v10; // $s1\\n  char *v11; // $s0\\n  char *v12; // $v0\\n  char *v13; // $v0\\n  const char *v14; // $a2\\n  unsigned i…(+6903 chars)"}

